Z||000000||fierosound||03-24-2001||07:09 PM|||| <A HREF="http://www.ck3.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.ck3.com/</A> <P>Hey guys...  just came across this site in Calgary.  Must be some secret production facility, because they are not in the phone book, but their facility exists.  It appears they only sell finished turn-keys.  It would also explain why cheap Fiero parts cars are rarely seen for sale anywhere in this city.  I expect they're snapping them up for their turnkey cars...<P>In the meantime, it'd be interesting to see what responses you'd get through their email to any enquiries you may make.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by fierosound (edited 03-24-2001).]||||reg||10
